<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Publishing on Best of AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tags/publishing/</link><description>Recent content in Publishing on Best of AI</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://bestofai.io/tags/publishing/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>baoyu-skills</title><link>https://bestofai.io/skills/jimliu-baoyu-skills/</link><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/skills/jimliu-baoyu-skills/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This repository bundles the following skills:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;baoyu-xhs-images&lt;/strong&gt;: Generates Xiaohongshu image card series in 12 art styles and 6 layouts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;baoyu-infographic&lt;/strong&gt;: Builds infographics from 21 layouts and 17 visual styles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;baoyu-diagram&lt;/strong&gt;: Produces SVG diagrams including flowcharts and sequence diagrams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;baoyu-cover-image&lt;/strong&gt;: Creates article cover images using a 5-dimension style system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;baoyu-slide-deck&lt;/strong&gt;: Turns written content into presentation slides with 16+ style presets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;baoyu-comic&lt;/strong&gt;: Generates educational comics in configurable art styles and tones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;baoyu-image-gen&lt;/strong&gt;: Generates images across multiple providers including OpenAI and Google.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;baoyu-youtube-transcript&lt;/strong&gt;: Downloads YouTube transcripts and subtitles with chapter support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;baoyu-url-to-markdown&lt;/strong&gt;: Converts web pages to markdown using Chrome CDP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;baoyu-translate&lt;/strong&gt;: Translates text with quick, normal, and refined modes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>Hocoos</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/hocoos/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/hocoos/</guid><description/></item><item><title>10Web</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/10web/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/10web/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Durable</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/durable/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/durable/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Framer</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/framer/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/framer/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Loom</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/loom/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/loom/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Pika Labs</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/pika-labs/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/pika-labs/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Runway</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/runway/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/runway/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Synthesia</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/synthesia/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/synthesia/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Wix ADI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/wix-adi/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/wix-adi/</guid><description/></item><item><title>InstaWebAI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/instawebai/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/instawebai/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>